#402006=PRODUCT('COTS_Motor_VT4130FW_300KV',
'COTS_Motor_VT4130FW_300KV v1',
'Vector Technics VT 4130 FW 300 KV cruise / pusher motor, 12S. Outer s
hape from datasheet 2D CAD p.1: \X\D850 x 57.2 body, \X\D86 shaft 2.4 
proud of the prop face, rear shaft end + bearing collar 3.4 proud of t
he mount face (needs a \X\D812 clearance hole). Mount 4x M4 x4 on PCD 
30 at 45\X\B0; prop face 4x M3 x8 on PCD 20 at 45\X\B0. Includes the s
upplied prop adapter (\X\D828 x 7 flange, \X\D88 x 28 shaft, 4x \X\D83
 thru + \X\D86 x4 cbore). X-mount cross plate from the drawing not mod
elled (SAGE uses its own plate). Origin = mount face centre, +Z toward
 prop. Motor 400 g (density tuned) + adapter (Al 6061).',(#401953));
#402007=PRODUCT('HW_Washer_M8_DIN125','HW_Washer_M8_DIN125 v1',
