#402033=PRODUCT('AV_Jetson_OrinNX_DevKit','AV_Jetson_OrinNX_DevKit v2',

'NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano Developer Kit (carrier P3768 + module P3767 w
ith heatsink/fan) - simplified from the NVIDIA CAD in SAGE/COTS (795 c
omps / 1921 bodies / ~56k faces -> 6 bodies, ~120 faces). Kept: carrie
r PCB, base frame, heatsink+fan+module block, rear I/O (RJ45, 2x dual 
USB-A, DP, DC jack, USB-C), 40-pin + button headers / SO-DIMM / CSI so
ckets, M.2 NVMe + Wi-Fi cards underneath. Removed: SMD parts, antennas
, screws, standoffs, leaf spring, hidden module PCB. Bbox 103.0 x 90.9
 x 34.8 mm, centred in X/Y, underside at Z -17.5 (as the old envelope)
; I/O on the -Y edge. 175 g (heatsink block density tuned). Orin NX mo
dules fit the same carrier.',(#401953));
#402034=PRODUCT('64_Avionics_Aft','64_Avionics_Aft',$,(#401953));
