#402037=PRODUCT('AV_ESC_APD_120F3','AV_ESC_APD_120F3 v3',
'APD 120F3 ESC (Advanced Power Drives) - simplified from the vendor ST
EP (736 bodies -> 6). Kept: PCB outline, power/phase pad tabs, 6 MOSFE
T packages, 330 uF bulk cap, 12x 1206 caps, underside ICs as blocks (b
ottom envelope). Removed: traces, silkscreen, logos, pins, leads, 0603
/0805 passives, diodes, IC internals. Envelope 59.0 x 29.0 x 14.1 mm, 
centred in X/Y, underside (ICs) at Z -10 like the old 70x30x20 envelop
e so it seats on the cradles; +X = motor-phase pads, -X = power/signal
 end, +Z = component side (bulk cap up). Mass 20 g (PCB density tuned).',
(#401953));
