#402040=PRODUCT('AV_LED_StrobeIT_Pro','AV_LED_StrobeIT_Pro v3',
'TeraVolt StrobeIT-Pro dual-LED navigation / anti-collision strobe (te
ravolt.in/product-page/strobeit-pro-dual-led-drone-strobe): 57 x 47 mm
 board, 1x high-power white anti-collision LED + 1x nav LED (red = por
t/left, green = starboard/right), constant-current drivers, 5 V, 6 W m
ax, PWM 1000-2000 us, 3-pin lead (VCC / signal / GND), M4 mounting pat
tern (49 x 39 assumed), module 5 g (shop page: < 8 g). SAGE installati
on: 2 mm PA-12 pad bonded to the winglet outboard skin, clear PC cover
 (bonded), PCB on 4x M4 nylon screws. Frame: origin = pad mounting fac
e centre, +Z = light direction, X = chordwise.',(#401953));
#402041=PRODUCT('AV_Antenna_Whip','AV_Antenna_Whip v1',$,(#401953));
#402042=PRODUCT('AV_LED_StrobeIT','AV_LED_StrobeIT v3',
'TeraVolt StrobeIT anti-collision RGB strobe (teravolt.in/product-page
/strobeit): 20 mm round PCB, RGB LED 3 W max, 5 V, 300 mA avg / 800 mA
 peak, PWM 1000-2000 us, onboard Hall sensor, 3-pin servo lead (GND / 
signal / 5 V) leaving the board centre through the saddle and a gromme
ted d5 hole in the drum, routed inside the mount to the wire tray, 2x 
M3 holes (15 mm spacing assumed), module < 5 g (4.5 g used). Includes 
the SAGE PA-12 saddle bonded to the outboard face of the d56 VTOL moun
t drum, 2 brass M3 heat-set inserts and 2x M3x6 button-head screws. Fr
ame: origin = PCB back face centre, +Z = light direction, Y = drum axi
s (vertical).',(#401953));
